This should be in the list archives, the FAQ, not to mention DEC's man page.

The file you are looking for is:
/etc/.AM_is_running

It was most likely left by someone crashing out of account manager, or
getting rebooted out.  Mkae sure there are no running dxaccounts processes
and then just delete the file.

