First off I'd like to thank John Bradley, Shlomo Hakim, and Ray Trzaska,
who put me on the right track.

Answer:

latcp -A -plat/624 -Hserver -Vmodem -RPORT_3 -O

Two notes here. 1. "server" is case sensitive. 2. -O is needed. This
disables queueing on the service.







