revision numbers (letter versions are not displayed):
464 = 4.0A
564 = 4.0B
664 = 4.0C
878 = 4.0D

Other suggestions included checking:
/etc/motd
/var/adm/messages

Or running:
/usr/sbin/uerf -c oper  -t s:<date-of-last-boot>

I was happy to discover that I'm running 4.0B.

Thanks!

ian

