Ok, thanks for the quick responses:

The two most prominent solutions:
(from Ann Cantelow)

If you have the sendmail daemon running, all you need to do is 
telnet to port 25, the sendmail port, on the machine.  Sendmail will 
announce what version it is and then you can just disconnect.

If you don't have the daemon running, I think /usr/sbin/sendmail -d0.1 
will display the version.



