        This problem may also occur on multiprocessor systems using the
        NFS client or graphics sub-systems.

The description of the problem is about as on target as possible (we
are using AdvFS, although not for / and /usr and this is an NFS client,
as well as server).  I installed the complete patch kit dated 6/10/98, 
which included this patch.  The problem persists.

Any ideas?  I have called DEC for support (we have a support contract),
