>    /proc                 0           0           0   100%    /proc
>    /dev/rz0g        901949      761687       50067    94%    /usr
>    /dev/rz6c       2030059           1     1827052     1%    /disk2
> 
> 5) Add the File system to /etc/fstab :
>    /dev/rz0a        /      ufs rw 1 1
>    /proc            /proc  procfs rw 0 0
