For awhile, I had a problem with last, and decided that the wtmp file
was too big (maybe 'last' has a limited buffer size?).  I moved aside
the existing wtmp file, then created a new one, and 'last' started
working again:
	cd /var/adm
	mv wtmp wtmp.old
	touch wtmp

