---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Here are the replies:

From: alan@nabeth.cxo.dec.com

        HSZ40, HSZ50 or HSZ70?

        I think the batteries for the HSZ50 and HSZ70 are the same
        and should be replaced every two years.  The HSZ40 batteries
        have a poor reputation and modern versions of the firmware
        have period power checks they perform on the batteries.  If
        you have an old version of HSOF, upgrade.

**********************************************************************************

>From rjackson@portal.gmu.edu 

Originally the batteries were advertised as having a life of 5 years.  Then
it was discovered, the hard way, the batteries were only good for about
one year.  The batteries shipping as of spring/summer of 1997 have a life
of two years.

