Since a few people have asked about this, I dug up the references.

If you are printing postscript from DU through an NT server, you
might very well get the raw postscript file printed, instead of the
desired result. This is a... Feature.. of NT. You can correct with the
following procedures described in the Microsoft Knowledge Base.

The easiest way is to goto the Microsoft Knowledge base

http://support.microsoft.com/support

then search for: article ID's Q168457 and/or Q150930

The first describes the process for 1 printer, the other for the
entire server.

