As explained in detail by Kris and others I had to set the
ethernet board to twisted pair in the following manner:

1) At the console prompt show the type of board(s) with

   >>> sh ew*

   I found out it is ewa0 only.

2) Show the options of ewa0_mode with

   >>> set ewa0_mode

3) Choose Twisted-Pair

   >>> set ewa0_mode Twisted-Pair

4) Reboot and that's all.

Concerning to the VXT2000+ terminal, it is working now without any
human intervention.

Cheers from the Worldchampsland (almost),

