Eskil,

I had a similar problem after a hardware upgrade which replaced the CPU
modules on my 8200.  Somehow the system date became > y2000.  If you look
at the "find" manpage you will see that you can compare file dates.  What
I did was touch a dummy file with a future date as appropriate (tomorrow
is a good one to use...) then ran find looking for files accessed after
that of the compare file and exec'ing a touch against those files.  I 
noticed no adverse affects.

